  "name": "Bloodmage: Running Wild kept through a battleground follows the battleground speed rule (#9356)",
  "contract": [
    "#9356 decision: Running Wild 800175 follows riding skill like other ground mounts, and in a battleground every",
    "ground mount runs at 100% whatever the riding skill (#12279). A mount kept when joining a battleground is",
    "recalculated on joining; Running Wild has to follow the same rule when the player is already running wild.",
    "AscensionBloodmageSecondary recalculates Running Wild's speed on every map change. Expected with Apprentice",
    "Riding (75): Running Wild runs at 60% (run speed rate 1.6) near Northshire, at 100% (rate 2.0) after entering",
    "Warsong Gulch while still running wild, and after leaving, if Running Wild is still active, at 60% again."
  ],
